{"id":"e052662a4a07aa17","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-ph-equivalence.md","title":"PH刻画定理","display":"thm-ph-equivalence — PH刻画定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-ph-equivalence","aliases":["29-thm-ph-equivalence"],"display":"thm-ph-equivalence — PH刻画定理","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-ph]]","[[29-df-so-hierarchy]]","[[29-thm-fagin]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 7.21; Corollary 7.22, pp.121–122, DjVu scans 136–137","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述已核对，证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-ph-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-ph-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ph-equivalence — PH刻画定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9120c20ece14d350\" href=\"?note=9120c20ece14d350\" title=\"29-df-ph\">29-df-ph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" href=\"?note=7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" title=\"29-df-so-hierarchy\">29-df-so-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6735bb68a79a1ef\" href=\"?note=c6735bb68a79a1ef\" title=\"29-thm-fagin\">29-thm-fagin</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 7.21; Corollary 7.22, pp.121–122, DjVu scans 136–137"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述已核对，证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> (词汇表, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9120c20ece14d350\" href=\"?note=9120c20ece14d350\" title=\"29-df-ph\">29-df-ph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau],\\Pi_k^p[\\tau],\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]\">\\(\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau],\\Pi_k^p[\\tau],\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9120c20ece14d350\" href=\"?note=9120c20ece14d350\" title=\"29-df-ph\">29-df-ph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau],Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau],Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" href=\"?note=7bd2cd8b0f2698f9\" title=\"29-df-so-hierarchy\">29-df-so-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ph\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\Bigl(\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau]=Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau]\\land\\Pi_k^p[\\tau]=Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ph\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\Bigl(\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau]=Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau]\\land\\Pi_k^p[\\tau]=Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ph\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ph\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 7.21 与 Corollary 7.22，印刷页 121–122、扫描页 136–137。已核对三种量词交替刻画的陈述；完整 oracle 与交替机器对应在书中留作 Exercise 7.24，本次未独立完成该练习。SO 的第 k 层取 k 个交替关系量词块，机器的第 k 层取至多 k−1 次状态种类切换；下层可加入无效量词而嵌入上层。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"9120c20ece14d350","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ph]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-fagin","status":"resolved","id":"c6735bb68a79a1ef","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-fagin]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"9120c20ece14d350","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau$ (词汇表, see [[29-df-ph]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"9120c20ece14d350","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau],\\Pi_k^p[\\tau],\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-ph]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7bd2cd8b0f2698f9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau],Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-so-hierarchy]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-fo-q-fo]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau],\\Pi_k^p[\\tau],\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau],Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ph\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\Bigl(\\Sigma_k^p[\\tau]=Q(\\Sigma_k^1)[\\tau]\\land\\Pi_k^p[\\tau]=Q(\\Pi_k^1)[\\tau]\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ph\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\mathrm{PH}[\\tau]=Q(\\mathrm{SO})[\\tau]","display":true}],"bytes":1467,"backlinks":[{"id":"46534a06054da129","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d76c8b012650fb73","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本条保留为 [[29-thm-ph-equivalence]] 的历史入口，层次刻画与其并集结论来自原书 Theorem 7.21、Corollary 7.22。两份正文的重复结论不计作独立数学结果。完整 oracle 对应证明的核验限制见标准入口。"},{"id":"8277156a4d684ae0","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ph]]、[[29-thm-ph-equivalence]] — 多项式层次"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-215","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-ph-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["b89b00b2e37a4ae5","9120c20ece14d350","7bd2cd8b0f2698f9","c6735bb68a79a1ef"]}